<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $59-5/8 (FIM 279.22).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $59-5/8 (FIM 279.22).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $2 at $59-5/8 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 279.22 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed up 4.50 markka at 270.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended up $0-1/4 at $35-1/4 on Wall Street on Tuesday. The price equals about 82.54 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 1.00 markka at 82.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed flat at $20-1/2 in New York on Tuesday. The price corresponds to about 96.00 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Rauma closed down 0.50 markka at 95.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
